      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Queries from European physicians about analgesic pharmacotherapy and responses from the author are presented. The topics addressed are the characterization and management of rebound headache which was recently reclassified by the International Headache Society as medication overuse headache, the relationship between migraine headaches and risk for stroke, and opioid-induced sweating."},
